msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Using ``'F'`` and ``'D'`` format type codes of the :mod:`struct` module now "
"are :term:`soft deprecated` in favor of two-letter forms ``'Zf'`` and "
"``'Zd'``. (Contributed by Sergey B Kirpichev in :gh:`121249`.)"
msgstr ""
